	)
	(text_box "Port 3 = sub-slot A1.3, hub port 3, busid 1-1.3.\nINA226 at 0x44; expander U6 (0x21).\nILIM 47k: 0.50–0.62 A; the -1 latches off after 7.5 ms in limit, FAULT_N flags it.\nINA226 Vbus on the shunt's load-side sense pad (= VBUS).\nEN pulled down: the port stays off until the node switches it on.\nPins: P1–P8 → crosspoint X lines (docs/electronics.md › DATA ×4 v2 map);\n  the LSF0108 passes nothing while its VREF is at 0 V or unconnected (a board that is off).\nVBUS LED: on while the port's switch is on (5V_SW, before the shunt)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 157.48 0)
		(size 294.64 22.86)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
